# Golden G-M0-3: parser compliance in one shot.
# Running status (three NoteOns from one status byte), NoteOn velocity 0
# normalized to a real NoteOff, and realtime F8 interleaved mid-message
# without breaking message assembly (the all-pass route forwards F8 too,
# and it must come out BEFORE the note completed around it).
port open in kbd
port open out synth
route kbd -> synth:5
@0 midi send kbd 90 3C 64 3E 5A 40 50
@10 midi send kbd 90 3C 00
@20 midi send kbd 90 F8 3D 42
advance 48
quit
